soft Outlook requires an active license. Verify your license to proceed with this One-Click Setup, please.'=>'A configuración cun clic para Microsoft Outlook require unha licenza activa. Comproba a túa licenza para continuar con esta configuración cun clic.','Sign in with Outlook'=>'Iniciar sesión con Outlook','You have successfully connected your site with your Outlook account. Now you can start sending emails through Outlook.'=>'Conectaches correctamente o teu sitio coa túa conta de Outlook. Xa podes comezar a enviar correos electrónicos a través de Outlook.','Provides a quick and easy way to connect to Outlook that doesn\'t require creating your own app.'=>'Ofrece unha forma rápida e sinxela de conectarse a Outlook sen ter que crear a túa propia aplicación.','%1$sFollow this link%2$s to get an API Key for Elastic Email.'=>'%1$sSegue esta ligazón%2$s para obter unha clave API de Elastic Email.','Read how to set up Elastic Email'=>'Le como configurar Elastic Email','Remove Server API Token'=>'Eliminar o token da API do servidor','Follow this link to get the Secret key from Mailjet: %s.'=>'Segue esta ligazón para obter a clave secreta de Mailjet: %s.','Remove Secret Key'=>'Eliminar a clave secreta','API Key Management'=>'Xestión de claves API','Follow this link to get the API key from Mailjet: %s.'=>'Segue esta ligazón para obter a clave API de Mailjet: %s.','Mailjet'=>'Mailjet','To get started, read our <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mailjet documentation</a>.'=>'Para comezar, le a nosa <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">documentación de Mailjet</a>.','<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mailjet</a> is a cloud-based email service platform that enables businesses to send marketing and transactional emails, offering features like email automation, real-time analytics, and responsive design templates. If you\'re just starting out, you can send up to 200 emails per day without a credit card.'=>'<a hre